     "titulo": "Places in the neighbourhood and locating them",
     "texto": [
      "To describe your neighbourhood, combine **hay** (to list available places) and **estar** (to give exact spatial locations).\n\nUseful prepositional phrases:\n- **enfrente de**: *La biblioteca está enfrente del colegio.* (opposite the school)\n- **al lado de**: *El supermercado está al lado del hotel.* (next to the hotel)\n- **cerca de** / **lejos de**: *El hospital está lejos del ayuntamiento.* (far from city hall)\n- **entre**: *El cine está entre el hotel y Correos.* (between the hotel and the post office)\n\nAlways remember the contraction **de + el = del**: *enfrente del colegio*."
     ],
